{
  "id": "PSA.81",
  "number": "81",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psalms 81",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "81",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 81"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "81",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "d"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician upon Gittith,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A Psalm",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of Asaph.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sing aloud unto God our strength: make a joyful noise unto the God of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Take a psalm, and bring hither the timbrel, the pleasant harp with the psaltery.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blow up the trumpet in the new moon, in the time appointed, on our solemn feast day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a statute for Israel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a law of the God of Jacob.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This he ordained in Joseph",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a testimony, when he went out through the land of Egypt:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "where",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I heard a language",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I understood not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I removed his shoulder from the burden: his hands were delivered from the pots.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou calledst in trouble, and I delivered thee; I answered thee in the secret place of thunder: I proved thee at the waters of Meribah. Selah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear, O my people, and I will testify unto thee: O Israel, if thou wilt hearken unto me;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There shall no strange god be in thee; neither shalt thou worship any strange god.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God, which brought thee out of the land of Egypt: open thy mouth wide, and I will fill it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But my people would not hearken to my voice; and Israel would none of me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I gave them up unto their own hearts' lust:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they walked in their own counsels.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oh that my people had hearkened unto me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Israel had walked in my ways!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I should soon have subdued their enemies, and turned my hand against their adversaries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The haters of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.81.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.81.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "should have submitted themselves unto him: but their time should have endured for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 81:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He should have fed them also with the finest of the wheat: and with honey out of the rock should I have satisfied thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.81.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.81.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.82",
    "number": "82",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  },
  "previous": {
    "id": "PSA.80",
    "number": "80",
    "bookId": "PSA"
  }
}